```{=html}
<div class="project-list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<div class="project-item" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
<h2 class="project-title"><a class="stretched-link" href="<%- item.path %>"><%- item.title %></a></h2>
<p class="project-desc"><%- item.description %></p>
<% if (item.categories) { %><p class="project-tags"><% for (const cat of item.categories) { %><span><%- cat %></span><% } %></p><% } %>
</div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
